 <strong>Lake</strong>, <strong>Rain</strong>, and <strong>Cloud</strong> bring atmospheric beauty.\"}}]\ne:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Modern & Trendy Unisex Names\"]}]\nf:[\"$\",\"p\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"Modern unisex names like <strong>Dakota</strong>, <strong>Riley</strong>, <strong>Quinn</strong>, <strong>Morgan</strong>, <strong>Reese</strong>, <strong>Jules</strong>, <strong>Blake</strong>, and <strong>Drew</strong> have become wildly popular for pets. They feel contemporary, friendly, and work across all species.\"}}]\n10:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Classic Gender-Neutral Names\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"p\",\"7\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"Some names have always been unisex. <strong>Casey</strong>, <strong>Jamie</strong>, <strong>Pat</strong>, <strong>Terry</strong>, <strong>Sam</strong>, <strong>Alex</strong>, and <strong>Charlie</strong> have worked across genders for generations. These timeless choices never feel dated.\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"8\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Food & Drink Unisex Names\"]}]\n13:[\"$\",\"p\",\"9\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"Food names are inherently gender-neutral and endlessly charming. <strong>Mochi</strong>, <strong>Cookie</strong>, <strong>Peanut</strong>, <strong>Oreo</strong>, <strong>Maple</strong>, <strong>Bean</strong>, <strong>Kiwi</strong>, and <strong>Mango</strong> feel sweet and approachable for any pet.\"}}]\n14:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"10\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Global Gender-Neutral Names\"]}]\n15:[\"$\",\"p\",\"11\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"Names from world languages add cultural richness. <strong>Kai</strong> (Hawaiian for sea), <strong>Rumi</strong> (Japanese), <strong>Sacha</strong> (Russian), <strong>Zuri</strong> (Swahili for beautiful), <strong>Noor</strong> (Arabic for light), <strong>Bodhi</strong> (Sanskrit for awakening).\"}}]\n16:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"12\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Why Choose a Gender-Neutral Name\"]}]\n17:[\"$\",\"p\",\"13\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Gender-neutral names give your pet an identity beyond traditional labels. They are inclusive, modern, and often more creative than gendered alternatives. They also avoid awkward moments when someone misgenders your pet — a scenario every pet owner has experienced!\"]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"❓ Frequently Asked Questions\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Why choose a gender-neutral pet name?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Gender-neutral names are inclusive, versatile, and often more creative. They avoid labeling your pet and work regardless of any assumptions about their personality or appearance.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Won't people be confused about whether my pet is male or female?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxe